  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br />Given quadratic is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />The roots are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>81</mn><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>72</mn><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Required Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac>